1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:06,967
Ninety-two steps down is a lot faster
than ninety-two steps up. Cedar
Street. The old school. One bench. One
sign.

2
00:00:07,467 --> 00:00:14,567
And one small boy in a yellow
raincoat, sitting very straight, with
his backpack on his knees and
headphones round his neck.

3
00:00:15,067 --> 00:00:15,633
Kai!

4
00:00:17,067 --> 00:00:20,500
You're late. The bus is late too. I
waited. Like the rule says.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:21,667
What rule?

6
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:28,433
Yours. Wait where you said you'd be.
Then somebody will come. You said it
on the boat, remember?
